{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"501110","name":"茸茸城堡大喵险","desc":"4.5版本活动 茸茸城堡大喵险","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/08/4521515/1d1ab5d832af1b0189862d60e147fccf_5165735604281756478.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"茸茸城堡大喵险","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/04/03/75276539/2adbbbcfa0b29e4b15fd3c4c7084c9f9_5452380910879424242.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/04/03/75276539/2adbbbcfa0b29e4b15fd3c4c7084c9f9_5452380910879424242.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e2024/04/08 10:00 ~ 2024/04/18 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/04/03/75276539/9ae76ebf42d5216c53c8a699750faecc_1562108238020115299.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/04/03/75276539/9ae76ebf42d5216c53c8a699750faecc_1562108238020115299.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e※完成魔神任务：第四章·第二幕「仿若无因飘落的轻雨」、世界任务「翠石砌玉壶·其一」后参与活动体验更佳。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● 活动开启后，每天都会解锁一个新的关卡，共五关。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● 每个关卡由布置「软绵绵喵屋」和在「咪呜呜宝座」与猫猫玩耍组成。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● 在布置「软绵绵喵屋」时，需要根据不同需求选择合适的摆设，让整体区域的属性分值不多不少正好符合需求。完成布置之后，可在猫碗里投喂食物来获得猫猫的认可。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● 投喂猫猫后，可在「咪呜呜宝座」召来对应的猫猫，或者直接邀请猫猫与其玩耍。旅行者可以抚摸猫猫不同部位，提升猫猫的好感度。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"流程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e猫猫一：雪糕的温暖小窝\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/10/4521515/fdba4aed09d286015a4182f88937708f_2435201085080493396.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"180\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/10/4521515/fdba4aed09d286015a4182f88937708f_2435201085080493396.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e糯糯软软的白色小猫，初见时可能显得有些怕生，但等到熟悉起来，它会变得非常亲昵和友好。所以，不妨勇敢地接近它，与它建立友谊吧!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与「雪糕」的友好度达到亲密无间后可获得：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×40，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×20000，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"820\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/1145c4b5ac9012f7a30f0b7e480e5b95_3312028965203811771.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「自由」的指引\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/820/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/820/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「自由」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e猫猫二：兔叽的跳跳树屋\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/10/4521515/bbf85015003527b9bbb07e40f51cd486_4760303641540143023.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"180\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/10/4521515/bbf85015003527b9bbb07e40f51cd486_4760303641540143023.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e灵巧而聪慧的灰白小猫,生有黑色条纹,如野兔般机敏好动。倘若有人愿意帮它整理前身与面部那因跑动而凌乱的毛发的话，想必定会赢得它的青睐吧…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与「兔叽」的友好度达到亲密无间后可获得：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×40，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×20000，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"823\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/022b46bfd2a41d7729113adf96d19e7a_8156851395918081382.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「抗争」的指引\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/823/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/823/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「抗争」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e猫猫三：团团灰的安逸居室\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/16/4521515/40a011c0761153f340f132f36f7fd4d6_187354086070636734.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"180\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/16/4521515/40a011c0761153f340f132f36f7fd4d6_187354086070636734.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e拥有翠绿双目的灰色猫猫，有着贵族般的优雅身姿。若想与它亲近，不妨试着模仿贵族的举止轻轻举起它的小爪，邀请它共舞一曲，这样或许能快速地拉近你们之间的距离。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与「团团灰」的友好度达到亲密无间后可获得：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×40，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×20000，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"826\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/7b726840ef48b8c43f702dafd02d3fd1_3828380004763806354.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「诗文」的指引\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/826/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/826/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「诗文」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e猫猫四：阿呆的奇幻乐园\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/16/4521515/2c67ff55c6e14227ae2316c3d4416f16_7570965474834260990.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"180\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/16/4521515/2c67ff55c6e14227ae2316c3d4416f16_7570965474834260990.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 180px\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e莽撞胆大且无所畏惧的黑白色花猫,似乎对身边发生的一切都充满了好奇心。据说，它喜欢用那灵动的尾巴直率地表达自己的情绪，因此与它的破冰之旅，不如就先从尾巴开始吧?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与「阿呆」的友好度达到亲密无间后可获得：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×40，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/605f7e564ce17decc9e09508567776ce_5737054899684571258.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"摩拉\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×20000，\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1025\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/20/15568211/d50fb37e3954b2b7105c61cf8f442c6e_7679619291811796065.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"大英雄的经验\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1025/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1025/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e大英雄的经验\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e×3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e猫猫五：奇妙猫猫的森严城堡\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e体型庞大，脾气似乎不太好的桔色猫猫，因为身上戴有骑士团徽记的围巾,被大家称为「大桔骑士」。和「大桔骑士」玩要时，还是小心一点为妙尽量耐心地找出它喜好和反感的部位…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与「大桔骑士」的友好度达到亲密无间后可获得：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e